{number: 13}
{title: All Hail The Power of Jesus' Name}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] All hail the power of [F] Jesus' [C] name!
Let [Am] angels [D7] prostrate [G] fall;
Bring [C] forth the royal [F] dia-[C] dem,
And [C] crown Him [G] Lord of [C] all;
Bring [F] forth the royal [C] diadem,
And [F] crown Him [C] Lord [G7] of [C] all!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
Ye [C] chosen seed of [F] Israel's [C] race,
Ye [Am] ransomed [D7] from the [G] fall,
Hail [C] Him Who saves you [F] by His [C] grace,
And [C] crown Him [G] Lord of [C] all;
Hail [F] Him Who saves you [C] by His grace,
And [F] crown Him [C] Lord [G7] of [C] all!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
Let [C] every kindred, [F] every [C] tribe,
On [Am] this ter-[D7] restrial [G] ball,
To [C] Him all majesty [F] as-[C] cribe,
And [C] crown Him [G] Lord of [C] all;
To [F] Him all majesty [C] ascribe,
And [F] crown Him [C] Lord [G7] of [C] all!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
O [C] that with yonder [F] sacred [C] throng
We [Am] at His [D7] feet may [G] fall!
We'll [C] join the ever-[F] lasting [C] song,
And [C] crown Him [G] Lord of [C] all;
We'll [F] join the ever-[C] lasting song,
And [F] crown Him [C] Lord [G7] of [C] all!
{end_of_verse}
